  <abstract><p>The menagerie of beasts and artefacts depicted in <eref type="inline" bibitemid="RFC8140" citeas="RFC&#xA0;8140"/> may be usefully supplemented by other renowned figures of Internet and more general lore. This document extends the menagerie to the seminal fable of the "Holy Hand Grenade of Antioch", as depicted in the Monty Python film  <eref type="inline" bibitemid="grail_film" citeas="[1]">"Monty Python and the Holy Grail"</eref>, as well as "Spamalot", the musical inspired by the movie.</p>
</abstract>
